// Expo regenerates this file on `expo start` and `expo export`, and its own template asks
// for it to be git-ignored. It is **committed** here on purpose: `pnpm typecheck` runs in
// CI without ever starting Expo, so an ignored file would make the app's types depend on
// whether somebody had run the dev server first — green locally, red in CI, for a reason
// nobody would look for. One line, no secrets, no build output.
